# Auto commit and push

After finishing a task that changes tracked files, **commit and push automatically**.

## When

- HTML/CSS/JS, AGENTS, rules, or skills changed and the work is complete

## When not

- User said not to commit this turn
- Hook failure — fix and make a **new** commit
- Secrets present — warn instead

## How

1. `git status` / `git diff`
2. Stage relevant files
3. Concise why-focused message
4. No Cursor trailers
5. `git push` (no force; no skip-hooks; do not update git config)

